  What's Next
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Behavioral analysis&lt;/strong&gt; — Post-deployment transaction pattern monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
