&lt;p&gt;In your env file add MEILI_MASTER_KEY and MEILI_HTTP_ADDR (use meilisearch service name from docker compose if the api is called within docker network).&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight shell"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;MEILI_MASTER_KEY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;super-secret-key
&lt;span class="c"&gt;# uncomment this for prod&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="c"&gt;# MEILI_HTTP_ADDR=http://chatcodfiscal-meilisearch:7700&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="c"&gt;# uncomment this for local&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nv"&gt;MEILI_HTTP_ADDR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;http://0.0.0.0:7700
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



